 2021 review on microbiome/antibiotics and ICI efficacy. Taxa associations, antibiotic timing.\n- Chapters: Ch1, Ch4\n\nP0565: 2026 systematic review on microbiome and ICI in melanoma. Taxa (F. prausnitzii, A. muciniphila), heterogeneity, methodology issues.\n- Chapters: Ch1 (melanoma-specific), Ch7 (methodological challenges)\n\nP0566: 2026 review on microbiome prediction in lung cancer. Gut vs oral, metabolites, antibiotics/PPIs.\n- Chapters: Ch1 (NSCLC), Ch4 (confounders), Ch7 (standardization needs)\n\nP0567: 2024 review on harnessing microbiome for immunotherapy. Taxa, mechanisms (metabolites, antigens), clinical trials.\n- Chapters: Ch1, Ch2, Ch3, Ch5\n\nP0568: 2025 review on ICI mechanisms and advances. Includes microbiome section - taxa, FMT, irAEs.\n- Chapters: Ch1, Ch2, Ch5, Ch6\n\nP0569: 2024 abstract on longitudinal microbiome in neoadjuvant NSCLC. Low diversity = better MPR, SCFA pathways, stability metrics.\n- Chapters: Ch1 (NSCLC neoadjuvant), Ch3 (SCFA)\n\nP0570: 2024 hypothesis paper on tumor-associated carbohydrates and microbiome. Antibody-mediated ADCC via Forssman antigen mimicry.\n- Chapters: Ch2 (alternative mechanisms - humoral immunity)\n\nP0571: 2025 review on microbiome and circadian rhythms. SCFAs, bile acids, chronopharmacology. NOT ICI-specific.\n- Chapters: Ch4 (circadian/timing factors)\n\nP0572: 2021 review on therapeutic interventions and mechanisms. Taxa, 4 mechanisms (polarization, metabolites, migration, mimicry), FMT/probiotics.\n- Chapters: Ch1, Ch2, Ch5\n\nP0573: 2025 review on optimizing FMT for ICI. Clinical evidence (success/failure), mechanisms (diversity, metabolites, TME), regulatory issues.\n- Chapters: Ch5 (","role":"assistant"},"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"logprobs":null}],"object":"chat.completion","usage":{"prompt_tokens":77938,"completion_tokens":10494,"total_tokens":88432,"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":2048,"text_tokens":10494},"prompt_tokens_details":{"text_tokens":77938}},"created":17911372